{% doc %}
  The reassurance block at the foot of the buy column: that paying is safe,
  how it ships, how they can pay, and what happens if something arrives wrong.
  Four plain statements, each with its own second line, because a shopper
  hesitating at this point is hesitating about one specific thing and skims
  for that one thing.

  Content is fixed here rather than merchant-typed. Every line is a stable
  brand truth, so there is nothing to keep in sync and nothing that can drift
  into a claim the store cannot honour.

  The last row says REPLACEMENT, not returns, and names the condition. The
  policy has three cases and only one of them is free: our mistake (wrong or
  damaged piece) is replaced free both ways, a size exchange is paid by the
  customer both ways, and a change of mind is refused outright. Calling this
  "7 day returns" promised something the store does not do. Shipping & returns
  on the product page and the FAQ carry the full version.

  The prepaid row earns its place twice: it is the delivery promise AND the
  reason to pay now. Prepaid orders skip the confirmation call a COD order
  waits on, so they genuinely do get packed first and arrive sooner, and
  saying so moves more orders to prepaid than the free delivery line alone.

  Cash on Delivery is the one conditional. It renders only when `cod` is
  passed, which the product page ties to the payment-perks setting, this
  store's flag for "the COD app is live". Until then the store never offers a
  way to pay that it cannot actually take.

  @param {string} [layout] - 'pdp' (default) or 'compact'.
  @param {boolean} [cod] - render the Cash on Delivery row.
  @example
  {% render 'tapi-trust-badges', layout: 'pdp', cod: section.settings.payment_perks %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- assign tb_layout = layout | default: 'pdp' -%}
<ul class="tapi-assure tapi-assure--{{ tb_layout }}" role="list">
  <li class="tapi-assure__row">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2.5l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 11-4.5-3-8-6-8-11v-6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
    <span class="tapi-assure__copy">
      <span class="tapi-assure__title">Secure payment</span>
      <span class="tapi-assure__sub">UPI, cards and netbanking on an encrypted checkout</span>
    </span>
  </li>
  <li class="tapi-assure__row">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 6.5h11v10H2zM13 9.5h4l3 3.5v3.5h-7z"/><circle cx="6" cy="18.5" r="1.7"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="18.5" r="1.7"/></svg>
    <span class="tapi-assure__copy">
      <span class="tapi-assure__title">Free delivery on prepaid orders</span>
      <span class="tapi-assure__sub">Packed on priority and on its way sooner, with nothing extra to pay</span>
    </span>
  </li>
  {%- if cod -%}
    <li class="tapi-assure__row">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 8.5h14.5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M3 8.5 5.6 5h10.2l2.2 3.5"/><circle cx="15" cy="13.5" r="1.7"/></svg>
      <span class="tapi-assure__copy">
        <span class="tapi-assure__title">Cash on Delivery available</span>
        <span class="tapi-assure__sub">Pay when your order arrives</span>
      </span>
    </li>
  {%- endif -%}
  <li class="tapi-assure__row">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 8a9 9 0 0 1 16-3.5M21 16a9 9 0 0 1-16 3.5"/><path d="M20.5 3v4.5H16M3.5 21v-4.5H8"/></svg>
    <span class="tapi-assure__copy">
      <span class="tapi-assure__title">7 day replacement</span>
      <span class="tapi-assure__sub">Wrong or damaged pieces replaced free, unworn with tags on</span>
    </span>
  </li>
</ul>
